@startuml F3.2-D01-criar-evento
title F3.2-D01 — Criar evento
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateEventUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Salvar evento
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /events
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  Valida fimEm > inicioEm,
  janelas e chCreditadas
end note
UC -> Postgres: INSERT evento\nAGENDADO
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC --> Ctrl: evento + _links
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Prof: /professor/eventos/:id

@enduml
